    "axis": "accessibility",
    "evidence": "Live Wire passes scoped automated WCAG checks, keyboard traversal/focus visibility, touch-target checks, reduced-motion sampling, and viewport overflow checks at all three sizes. However, document-level evidence remains incomplete: a serious prohibited ARIA use exists on the intent/payment comparison div, contrast could not be verified for many elements, and no header touch-target measurements were supplied. Tablet/mobile header links are also clipped inside a horizontal navigation region, though no page-level overflow occurs.",
